<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold Animal</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Ranger (guild level 17, up to 50%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold animal &lt;animal&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster spits upon the ground and utters 'Animalius desi', and magic 
engulfs an animal (a beast, bird, reptile, amphibian, insect or worm), 
leaving it unable to fight. It misses its next five combat rounds, and it 
can't flee in panic meanwhile.
</p><p>The animal resists with its mind, and the spell often fails. Casting it is 
an attack, so the animal will fight you if it wasn't already. It works on 
nothing but animals: for others, see hold monster and hold undead. It is 
also found on wands, scrolls and potions.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Monster</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charm Animal</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>